      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And þus hit stod on ðam dagum inne mid Englum ðæt gyf feorhscyldig man cyning gesohte, arcebiscop, oððon æþeling, þonne ahte he nigon nihta grið feore to gebeorge, butan him se cyng rumran fyrstes geunnan wolde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And it so stood in those days among the English that if a condemned man sought the king, the archbishop, or a nobleman, then he had nine nights’ sanctuary in which to save his life, unless the king wished to grant him more time.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 þus hit stod on ðam dagum inne mid Englum, ðæt, gyf feorhscyldig man cyning gesohte, arcebiscop oððon æþeling, þonne ahte he nigon nihta grið feore to gebeorge, butan him se cyng rumran fyrstes geunnan wolde.</ab>
      </div>
